From 0ddb54ab532faab391ecb2ec9e6d5c6b4a1012e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ci <ci@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:28:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] eriri-sdk: drop the SAP service discovery (E006)

Every launch logs ten multicast errors, from net_Subscribe() in
src/network/udp.c:

    cannot join multicast group: Invalid argument
    cannot join multicast group: Can't assign requested address

They come from the sap service discovery: modules/services_discovery/sap.c
joins four IPv4 groups plus their IPv6 counterparts when it opens, and the
medialibrary pulls the available discoveries up when it enumerates network
devices at startup. The joins fail on this machine, whose only IPv4 address is
on en1 while two dozen other interfaces (utun*, awdl0, nan0, ap1, bridge0)
exist: the IPv6 join carries no interface index (EINVAL), the IPv4 one has no
address to use (EADDRNOTAVAIL). Nothing is broken by it, but ten error lines per
launch are noise, and nothing in Eriri listens to SAP announcements: it is a
local player, SAP is streams announced on the LAN.

Unlike dsm there is no --disable-sap, so the patch drops the plugin from the
build instead. Nothing else compiles access/rtp/sdp.c out of existence: the rtp
access and its tests keep it.

Verified by bisection, one app launch each: every service-discovery plugin
present -> 10 errors; all of them disabled -> 0; sap alone restored -> 10 again;
upnp alone disabled -> still 10, so it is not the one failing.
---
 modules/services_discovery/Makefile.am | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/modules/services_discovery/Makefile.am b/modules/services_discovery/Makefile.am
index 28c2ce4ad7..297c361395 100644
--- a/modules/services_discovery/Makefile.am
+++ b/modules/services_discovery/Makefile.am
@@ -15,11 +15,6 @@ sd_PLUGINS += libpodcast_plugin.la
 libradio_plugin_la_SOURCES = services_discovery/radio.c
 sd_PLUGINS += libradio_plugin.la
 
-libsap_plugin_la_SOURCES = services_discovery/sap.c access/rtp/sdp.c
-libsap_plugin_la_CPPFLAGS = $(AM_CPPFLAGS)
-libsap_plugin_la_LIBADD = $(SOCKET_LIBS) $(LIBZ)
-sd_PLUGINS += libsap_plugin.la
-
 libavahi_plugin_la_SOURCES = services_discovery/avahi.c
 libavahi_plugin_la_CFLAGS = $(AM_CFLAGS) $(AVAHI_CFLAGS)
 libavahi_plugin_la_LDFLAGS = $(AM_LDFLAGS) $(sd_RPATH)
